   The root element is `<restrictions>`.
   Child elements are `<restriction>`.
   Each `<restriction>` has attributes:
   - `android:key` (required)
   - `android:title` (required)
   - `android:description` (optional)
   - `android:restrictionType` (required) - values: "bool", "string", "integer", "choice", "multi-select", "bundle", "bundle_array"
